{"id":"torrey:christ-the-shepherd","source":"torrey","name":"Christ, The Shepherd","slug":"christ-the-shepherd","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Foretold — Ge 49:24; Isa 40:11; Eze 34:23; 37:24.","refs":[["Gen",49,24,49,24],["Isa",40,11,40,11],["Ezek",34,23,34,23],["Ezek",37,24,37,24]]},{"text":"The chief — 1Pe 5:4.","refs":[["1Pet",5,4,5,4]]},{"text":"The good — Joh 10:11,14.","refs":[["John",10,11,10,11],["John",10,14,10,14]]},{"text":"The great — Mic 5:4; Heb 13:20.","refs":[["Mic",5,4,5,4],["Heb",13,20,13,20]]},{"text":"He knows. — Joh 10:14,27.","refs":[["John",10,14,10,14],["John",10,27,10,27]]},{"text":"He calls. — Joh 10:3.","refs":[["John",10,3,10,3]]},{"text":"He gathers. — Isa 40:11; Joh 10:16.","refs":[["Isa",40,11,40,11],["John",10,16,10,16]]},{"text":"He guides. — Ps 23:3; Joh 10:3,4.","refs":[["Ps",23,3,23,3],["John",10,3,10,3],["John",10,4,10,4]]},{"text":"He feeds. — Ps 23:1,2; Joh 10:9.","refs":[["Ps",23,1,23,1],["Ps",23,2,23,2],["John",10,9,10,9]]},{"text":"He cherishes tenderly. — Isa 40:11.","refs":[["Isa",40,11,40,11]]},{"text":"He protects and preserves. — Jer 31:10; Eze 34:10; Zec 9:16; Joh 10:28.","refs":[["Jer",31,10,31,10],["Ezek",34,10,34,10],["Zech",9,16,9,16],["John",10,28,10,28]]},{"text":"He laid down his life for. — Zec 13:7; Mt 26:31; Joh 10:11,15; Ac 20:28.","refs":[["Zech",13,7,13,7],["Matt",26,31,26,31],["John",10,11,10,11],["John",10,15,10,15],["Acts",20,28,20,28]]},{"text":"He gives eternal life to. — Joh 10:28.","refs":[["John",10,28,10,28]]},{"text":"David. — 1Sa 16:11.","refs":[["1Sam",16,11,16,11]]}],"refCount":32}
